INSERT INTO `locales_spell` VALUES (13809, 'Frost Trap', '', '', '', '冰霜陷阱', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Place a frost trap that creates an ice slick around itself for $13810d when the first enemy approaches it.  All enemies within $13810a1 yards will be slowed by $14207s1% while in the area of effect.  Trap will exist for $d.  Traps can only be placed when out of combat.  Only one trap can be active at a time.', '', '', '', '放置一个冰霜陷阱，在敌人接近时会制造一片光滑的冰面，持续$13810d。所有在陷阱周围半径$13810a1码范围内的敌人的移动速度都会降低$14207s1%。陷阱可以存在$d。只能在非战斗状态下布置陷阱。每次只能布置一个陷阱。', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
