INSERT INTO `locales_spell` VALUES (45490, 'Moon\'s Blessing', '', '', '', '月亮的祝福', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Heal your target for $s1 and increase healing taken by up to $s2 for $d.', '', '', '', '花费 $s1 治愈你的目标，并花费 $d 增加最多 $s2 的治疗效果。', '', '', 'Increases healing received by up to $s2.', '', '', '', '增加最多 $s2 收到的治疗效果。', '', '');
